RITOURISM Act</strong></p><p>This bill directs the Department of Agriculture to designate an&nbsp;Agritourism Advisor within the&nbsp;Office of the Under Secretary for Rural Development. The advisor must encourage and promote&nbsp;agritourism activities and businesses in each state and on land under the jurisdiction of Indian tribes.</p><p>Under the bill, agritourism&nbsp;activities and agritourism businesses include educational experiences,&nbsp;outdoor recreation,&nbsp;entertainment and special events,&nbsp;direct sales, and accommodations.</p>","updateDate":"2026-04-08T14:00:03Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"AGRITOURISM Act","type":"s","updateDate":"2026-07-14T11:03:22Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-14T11:03:22Z"}
